<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Credence Systems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Credence Systems.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Credence Systems Corp as neutral, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1-1/8 at 15-1/2.</p>
</text>
